      "cause": "The 105px revenue and 95px growth widths reduce wrapping, but together with the other columns they produce a 460px table."
    },
    {
      "design": "r1C",
      "good": "All four metrics are visible together without horizontal scrolling, and the compact data rows support comparisons across regions.",
      "problems": "The header is much taller than the body and is difficult to scan: several words break into small fragments, obscuring the metric names. This visual fragmentation outweighs the benefit of seeing the whole table at once.",
      "cause": "The metric columns leave only 47–57px for text after padding and borders, less than the width of several header words. The reported zero mid-word splits does not match the visible render."
    }
